      "writtenOn": "2019-06-04T12:57:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What about inheriting the parent directory package default_visibility before falling back to this?\n\nWhat this feature gives over normal defaults inheritance is the guarantee that no modules are unintentionally missed. With a parent directory fallback that would extend to a whole directory tree, so we could e.g. put a default_visibility\u003d[\"//art:__subpackages__\"] in art/Android.bp and be assured it applies everywhere in art/ where there aren\u0027t other visibility properties.",
